-- a lookup by user without an index reads the whole table
plan for user_id = U4242 (no index) | Seq Scan
plan for user_id = U4242 (with index) | Index Scan
plan uses booking_user_idx | t
rows found | 1
-- a composite index serves its leftmost column, not the second column alone
seat_id = Z7 AND status = CANCELLED uses composite | t
status = HELD alone uses composite | f
wrapping the column in lower() uses booking_user_idx | f
